Historical bounded ARM64 GICv3 table handoff baseline; no new logic.

Apply after kexec_target_trace_diag_6.6.89.patch. This packages the
already-built gic-fix/source owned-table snapshot, allocator exclusion,
target FDT reservation and final snapshot verification. The native
ramoops additions are in the following separate diagnostic patch.
CONFIG_ARM64_KEXEC_GIC_TABLES defaults n. This preserves bounded table
memory only and does not establish complete GIC/ITS/DMA quiescence.
No shutdown control bits, head.S, reset or relocation assembly change.

